    "订阅无对应规则集时，GEOIP,CN 和 GEOSITE,cn 使用公开列表，由内核每天直连下载一次。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Without a subscription rule set, GEOIP,CN and GEOSITE,cn use public lists, downloaded directly by the engine once a day."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "訂閱無對應規則集時，GEOIP,CN 和 GEOSITE,cn 使用公開清單，由核心每天直連下載一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
