    "导入带规则和策略组的订阅后，可在此按订阅规则分流并切换策略组。当前全部流量走所选节点。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After importing a subscription with rules and policy groups, route by its rules and switch policy groups here. All traffic currently goes through the selected node."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匯入帶規則和策略組的訂閱後，可在此按訂閱規則分流並切換策略組。目前全部流量走所選節點。"
          }
        }
      }
