    "首次连接时，iOS 会请求添加 VPN 配置，仅用于将流量交给本 App 分流，不收集浏览记录。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On first connection, iOS requests to add a VPN configuration, used only to hand traffic to this app for routing; browsing is not collected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次連線時，iOS 會請求新增 VPN 設定，僅用於將流量交給本 App 分流，不收集瀏覽記錄。"
