    "节点「%@」无法连接：设备时间快约 %lld 分钟。请在设置中开启“自动设置”时间后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%1$@” cannot connect: the device clock is about %2$lld minutes fast. Turn on Set Automatically in Settings › General › Date & Time, then retry."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "節點「%@」無法連線：裝置時間快約 %lld 分鐘。請在設定中開啟「自動設定」時間後重試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "节点「%@」无法连接：设备时间慢约 %lld 分钟。请在设置中开启“自动设置”时间后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%1$@” cannot connect: the device clock is about %2$lld minutes slow. Turn on Set Automatically in Settings › General › Date & Time, then retry."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "節點「%@」無法連線：裝置時間慢約 %lld 分鐘。請在設定中開啟「自動設定」時間後重試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "节点「%@」被服务器拒绝：订阅可能已到期或被重置，或设备时间不准。请更新订阅或校准时间后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server rejected “%@”: the subscription may have expired or been reset, or the device clock is off. Update the subscription or correct the time, then retry."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "節點「%@」被伺服器拒絕：訂閱可能已到期或被重設，或裝置時間不準。請更新訂閱或校準時間後重試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
