    "崩溃报告": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Crash reports"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "當機報告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "崩溃时记录脱敏后的信息（不含网址、账号和节点地址），只保存在本机，复制诊断信息时附上。关闭会删除已保存的报告。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keeps a redacted record when the app crashes (no URLs, accounts or node addresses), on this device only, and adds it to the copied diagnostics. Turning this off deletes saved reports."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "當機時記錄去識別化後的資訊（不含網址、帳號和節點位址），只儲存在本機，複製診斷資訊時附上。關閉會刪除已儲存的報告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "软件更新": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Software Update"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "軟體更新"
          }
        }
      }
