    "这个版本没有配置更新源，请从发布页下载新版本。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This build has no update source. Download new versions from the release page."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個版本沒有設定更新來源，請從發布頁下載新版本。"
