        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用前請閱讀用戶協議"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅在本人设备上使用；不得在他人不知情时为其安装或开启代理、HTTPS 解密和脚本。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use only on the user's own devices. Never install or turn on a proxy, HTTPS decryption or scripts for someone without their knowledge."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "僅在本人裝置上使用；不得在他人不知情時為其安裝或開啟代理、HTTPS 解密和腳本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTPS 解密仅用于本人的流量。根证书由本人在系统设置中手动信任，仅解密所列域名。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS decryption is for the device owner's own traffic only. The owner trusts the root certificate manually in Settings, and only the listed domains are decrypted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS 解密僅用於本人的流量。根憑證由本人在系統設定中手動信任，僅解密所列網域。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不得用于入侵他人系统、窃取数据，或绕过游戏、支付、登录等服务的安全机制。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Never use it to break into other people's systems, steal data, or get around the security of games, payments, sign-in or other services."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不得用於入侵他人系統、竊取資料，或繞過遊戲、支付、登入等服務的安全機制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本 App 不提供节点或订阅，导入的内容由提供方负责。软件按现状提供，不作担保。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This app provides no nodes or subscriptions; the provider of imported content is responsible for it. The software is provided as is, without warranty."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本 App 不提供節點或訂閱，匯入的內容由提供方負責。軟體按現狀提供，不作擔保。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "阅读完整协议": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
