        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 個網域"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅解密此处、插件和映射中所列域名，其余 HTTPS 原样转发。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only domains listed here, in plugins and in mappings are decrypted; other HTTPS passes through untouched."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "僅解密此處、外掛和對應中所列網域，其餘 HTTPS 原樣轉發。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "api.example.com 或 *.example.com": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "api.example.com or *.example.com"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "api.example.com 或 *.example.com"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "写 *.example.com 包含它的所有子域名。需要先信任 HTTPS 解密证书，保存后连接中的隧道会自动重连。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "*.example.com includes all of its subdomains. Trust the HTTPS decryption certificate first; a connected tunnel reconnects after saving."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "寫 *.example.com 包含它的所有子網域。需要先信任 HTTPS 解密憑證，儲存後連線中的通道會自動重新連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "暂无域名": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No domains"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暫無網域"
          }
        }
      }
    },
