            "state": "translated",
            "value": "替換為團隊已有的 CA，各裝置信任同一根憑證。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存证书失败（%@）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not save the certificate (%@)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "儲存憑證失敗（%@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没有读到证书，请粘贴以 BEGIN CERTIFICATE 开头的 PEM 文本。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No certificate found. Paste PEM text that starts with BEGIN CERTIFICATE."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有讀到憑證，請貼上以 BEGIN CERTIFICATE 開頭的 PEM 文字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这张证书不是 CA 证书，不能用来签发其他证书。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is not a CA certificate, so it cannot sign other certificates."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這張憑證不是 CA 憑證，不能用來簽發其他憑證。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "私钥需要是 P-256（prime256v1）的 PEM 私钥，以 BEGIN PRIVATE KEY 或 BEGIN EC PRIVATE KEY 开头。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The private key must be a P-256 (prime256v1) PEM key starting with BEGIN PRIVATE KEY or BEGIN EC PRIVATE KEY."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "私鑰需要是 P-256（prime256v1）的 PEM 私鑰，以 BEGIN PRIVATE KEY 或 BEGIN EC PRIVATE KEY 開頭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "私钥和证书不是一对。": {
