            "state": "translated",
            "value": "System Proxy Only"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "僅系統代理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切换时如果已连接，会自动重连一次。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If connected, switching reconnects once."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切換時如果已連線，會自動重新連線一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VPN 接管全部流量，并将系统 HTTP / HTTPS 代理指向本机。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The VPN takes all traffic and points the system HTTP / HTTPS proxy to this device."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VPN 接管全部流量，並將系統 HTTP / HTTPS 代理指向本機。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅用 VPN 接管全部流量，不设置系统代理。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The VPN alone takes all traffic, with no system proxy."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "僅用 VPN 接管全部流量，不設定系統代理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅设置系统 HTTP / HTTPS 代理，不创建默认路由；不遵守代理设置的 App 和 UDP 流量直接出去。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sets only the system HTTP / HTTPS proxy, with no default route; apps that ignore the proxy and UDP traffic go out directly."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "僅設定系統 HTTP / HTTPS 代理，不建立預設路由；不遵守代理設定的 App 和 UDP 流量直接出去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每行一项：域名、通配符（*.local）、IP 或网段（192.168.0.0/16）。这些地址不走系统代理。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One per line: a domain, a wildcard (*.local), an IP or a network (192.168.0.0/16). These addresses skip the system proxy."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每行一項：網域、萬用字元（*.local）、IP 或網段（192.168.0.0/16）。這些位址不走系統代理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "第 %@ 行不是域名、通配符或网段，保存时会去掉。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Line %@ is not a domain, wildcard or network and will be left out when saved."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第 %@ 行不是網域、萬用字元或網段，儲存時會去掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "填入默认列表": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fill In Default List"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "填入預設清單"
          }
        }
