            "state": "translated",
            "value": "斷開時自動儲存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "另有 %lld 个连接没有解密出请求，查看域名 ›": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld more connections showed no decrypted requests. See their domains ›"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "另有 %lld 個連線沒有解密出請求，查看網域 ›"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "连接已断开，抓包停止。断开前抓到的内容已加密保存，可在 ⋯ › 已保存的会话 查看。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disconnected; capture stopped. What was captured is saved encrypted and available in ⋯ › Saved Sessions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "連線已斷開，擷取停止。斷開前擷取的內容已加密儲存，可在 ⋯ › 已儲存的工作階段 查看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "抓到的连接 · %lld 个域名或地址": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Captured connections · %lld domains or addresses"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "抓到的連線 · %lld 個網域或位址"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这些连接未解密，仅抓到加密的 TLS 数据，点进去可看原始字节。点“解密”将域名加入解密列表，隧道重新连接，新连接会被解密并列在上方。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These connections were not decrypted; only encrypted TLS data was captured, and the raw bytes can be opened. Tap “Decrypt” to add the domain to the decryption list; the tunnel reconnects and new connections are decrypted and listed above."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這些連線未解密，僅擷取到加密的 TLS 資料，點進去可看原始位元組。點「解密」將網域加入解密列表，隧道重新連線，新連線會被解密並列在上方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这些连接未解密，仅抓到加密的 TLS 数据，点进去可看原始字节。点“解密”将域名加入解密列表，隧道重新连接，新连接会被解密并列在请求中。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These connections were not decrypted; only encrypted TLS data was captured, and the raw bytes can be opened. Tap “Decrypt” to add the domain to the decryption list; the tunnel reconnects and new connections are decrypted and listed with the requests."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這些連線未解密，僅擷取到加密的 TLS 資料，點進去可看原始位元組。點「解密」將網域加入解密列表，隧道重新連線，新連線會被解密並列在請求中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTPS 解密没有生效：隧道启动时找不到根证书。请在 改写 › HTTPS 解密证书 生成并信任，再重新连接。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS decryption is not active: the tunnel found no root certificate when it started. Create and trust one in Rewrite › HTTPS Decryption Certificate, then reconnect."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS 解密沒有生效：隧道啟動時找不到根憑證。請在 改寫 › HTTPS 解密憑證 產生並信任，再重新連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTPS 解密没有生效：隧道读不到钥匙串里的根证书。请重新连接；仍不行就在 改写 › HTTPS 解密证书 重新生成。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS decryption is not active: the tunnel could not read the root certificate from the Keychain. Reconnect; if that does not help, create it again in Rewrite › HTTPS Decryption Certificate."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS 解密沒有生效：隧道讀不到鑰匙圈裡的根憑證。請重新連線；仍不行就在 改寫 › HTTPS 解密憑證 重新產生。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTPS 解密没有生效：内核没有接受解密设置。请检查已启用的插件，开发者诊断的扩展事件里有原因。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS decryption is not active: the engine did not accept the decryption settings. Check the enabled plugins; the extension events in developer diagnostics give the reason."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS 解密沒有生效：核心沒有接受解密設定。請檢查已啟用的外掛，開發者診斷的擴充事件裡有原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已把 %@ 加入解密列表，隧道正在重新连接；之后的新连接会列出请求。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Added %@ to the decryption list. The tunnel is reconnecting; new connections will list their requests."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已把 %@ 加入解密列表，隧道正在重新連線；之後的新連線會列出請求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已抓到 %lld 个连接，均未解密出请求。下方按域名列出这些连接。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Captured %lld connections, none decrypted into requests. They are listed by domain below."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已擷取 %lld 個連線，均未解密出請求。下方按網域列出這些連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "解密": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Decrypt"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解密"
          }
        }
      }
    },
