    },
    "写两个字母的国家代码（如 US）或 AS 号（如 AS13335）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter a two-letter country code (such as US) or an AS number (such as AS13335)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "填兩個字母的國家代碼（如 US）或 AS 號（如 AS13335）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GeoIP 与 ASN 数据": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GeoIP and ASN Data"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GeoIP 與 ASN 資料"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "客户端仅内置中国大陆的 GeoIP 列表。其他国家的 GEOIP 和 IP-ASN 规则需按 URL 添加开源列表，经代理每天下载一次。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app builds in only the mainland China GeoIP list. GEOIP rules for other countries and IP-ASN rules need an open-source list added by URL, downloaded through the proxy once a day."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 只內建中國大陸的 GeoIP 清單。其他國家的 GEOIP 和 IP-ASN 規則需按網址新增開源清單，經代理每天下載一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "最多 16 个数据列表。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At most 16 data lists."
          }
