    "两位国家或地区代码，如 CN。CN 以外需在下方 GeoIP 与 ASN 数据中添加列表。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A two-letter country or region code, such as CN. Countries other than CN need a list under GeoIP and ASN Data below."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兩位國家或地區代碼，如 CN。CN 以外需在下方 GeoIP 與 ASN 資料中新增清單。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AS 号，如 AS13335。需在下方 GeoIP 与 ASN 数据中添加该 AS 的列表。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An AS number, such as AS13335. Needs a list for this AS under GeoIP and ASN Data below."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AS 號，如 AS13335。需在下方 GeoIP 與 ASN 資料中新增該 AS 的清單。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IPV4、IPV6、DOMAIN（带点的域名）或 SIMPLE（不带点的主机名）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "IPV4, IPV6, DOMAIN (a domain with a dot) or SIMPLE (a host name without one)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "IPV4、IPV6、DOMAIN（帶點的網域）或 SIMPLE（不帶點的主機名稱）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac 作为网关时，按在“设备名”里给局域网设备起的名字匹配。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With the Mac as the gateway, matches the names given to LAN devices under Device Names."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 作為閘道時，依在「裝置名稱」裡為區域網路裝置取的名稱比對。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TCP、UDP、QUIC、HTTP、HTTPS、STUN，或 DOH、DOQ（只匹配经代理发出的加密 DNS 查询）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TCP, UDP, QUIC, HTTP, HTTPS, STUN, or DOH and DOQ (only the encrypted DNS queries sent through the proxy)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TCP、UDP、QUIC、HTTP、HTTPS、STUN，或 DOH、DOQ（只比對經代理送出的加密 DNS 查詢）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "写设备的 IP 地址和 1 到 64 个字符的名字（不含逗号）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter the device's IP address and a name of 1 to 64 characters without commas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "填寫裝置的 IP 位址和 1 到 64 個字元的名稱（不含逗號）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "发起连接的源端口，一个端口或 起-止 范围。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The source port the connection comes from: one port or a start-end range."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "發起連線的來源連接埠，一個連接埠或 起-止 範圍。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "名字": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Name"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名稱"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "当前网络：SSID:名称、BSSID:地址、ROUTER:网关 IP、TYPE:WIFI / WIRED / CELLULAR，或本机地址所在的网段。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The current network: SSID:name, BSSID:address, ROUTER:gateway IP, TYPE:WIFI / WIRED / CELLULAR, or a network this device's address is in."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目前網路：SSID:名稱、BSSID:位址、ROUTER:閘道 IP、TYPE:WIFI / WIRED / CELLULAR，或本機位址所在的網段。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "最多 %lld 个设备名。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At most %lld device names."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最多 %lld 個裝置名稱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "为将这台 Mac 用作网关的设备命名，DEVICE-NAME 规则按名称匹配（不区分大小写）。设备按来源 IP 识别，建议在路由器中固定其地址。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Names devices that use this Mac as their gateway; DEVICE-NAME rules match these names, ignoring case. Devices are identified by source IP; a fixed address in the router is recommended."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "為將這台 Mac 用作閘道的裝置取名，DEVICE-NAME 規則依名稱比對（不分大小寫）。裝置依來源 IP 辨認，建議在路由器中固定其位址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "蜂窝网络制式，例如 LTE、NR（5G）。只在使用蜂窝网络时匹配。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The cellular radio technology, such as LTE or NR (5G). Matches only on cellular."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "行動網路制式，例如 LTE、NR（5G）。只在使用行動網路時比對。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "订阅含 CELLULAR-RADIO 规则，Mac 不支持，规则不生效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The subscription has CELLULAR-RADIO rules; a Mac does not support them, so they have no effect."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "訂閱含 CELLULAR-RADIO 規則，Mac 不支援，規則不生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "订阅含 DEVICE-NAME 规则，iPhone 和 iPad 不支持，规则不生效。": {
      "localizations": {
