          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not GET"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "非 GET"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "大于 100 KB": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Over 100 KB"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "大於 100 KB"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本地应答": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Answered locally"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本機回應"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "连接后，经过隧道的 HTTP 请求会逐条列在这里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once connected, HTTP requests through the tunnel are listed here one by one."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "連線後，經過隧道的 HTTP 請求會逐條列在這裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "当前内核不支持请求列表，请在右上角查看全部连接。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This engine version has no request list. See all connections at the top right."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目前核心不支援請求列表，請在右上角查看全部連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "抓包未开启。开始抓包后，新的请求会出现在这里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Capture is off. New requests appear here once capture starts."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "擷取未開啟。開始擷取後，新的請求會出現在這裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "表达式有误，改正后再筛选。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The expression has an error. Fix it to filter."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "運算式有誤，改正後再篩選。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没有匹配的请求": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No matching requests"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有符合的請求"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "暂无请求。HTTPS 请求需先在 扩展 › HTTPS 解密证书 中安装并信任根证书，再为域名启用解密。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No requests. HTTPS requests need the root certificate installed and trusted in Extensions › HTTPS Decryption Certificate, then decryption turned on for the domains."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暫無請求。HTTPS 請求需先在 擴充功能 › HTTPS 解密憑證 中安裝並信任根憑證，再為網域啟用解密。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "表达式有误": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The expression has an error"
          }
        },
