    "当前未保存的抓包内容会被替换，抓包会停止。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The current unsaved capture is replaced and capture stops."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目前未儲存的擷取內容會被取代，擷取會停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除后无法恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This cannot be undone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刪除後無法復原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法读取（密钥不符或文件损坏）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cannot be read (wrong key or damaged file)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法讀取（金鑰不符或檔案損毀）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会话用仅保存在本机钥匙串中的密钥加密，保留 7 天后自动删除。打开会话会替换当前抓包内容并停止抓包。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sessions are encrypted with a key kept only in this device's keychain and deleted automatically after 7 days. Opening a session replaces the current capture and stops capturing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作階段用僅保存在本機鑰匙圈中的金鑰加密，保留 7 天後自動刪除。開啟工作階段會取代目前的擷取內容並停止擷取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "连接后可以查看和打开已保存的会话。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect to view and open saved sessions."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "連線後可以檢視和開啟已儲存的工作階段。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这台设备上无法保存会话（钥匙串不可用）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sessions cannot be saved on this device (the keychain is unavailable)."
          }
