            "value": "No messages"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有訊息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只读查看：消息原样转发，不能改写。每个请求保留最近 512 条、每条前 4 KiB。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read-only: messages are forwarded as they are and cannot be rewritten. Each request keeps the latest 512 messages, the first 4 KiB of each."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "唯讀檢視：訊息原樣轉發，不能改寫。每個請求保留最近 512 則、每則前 4 KiB。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "事件原样逐条转发给 App。每个请求保留最近 512 条、每条前 4 KiB。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Events are forwarded to the app one by one as they are. Each request keeps the latest 512, the first 4 KiB of each."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
