    "返回": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Back"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "返回"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "放弃修改": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Discard Changes"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "放棄修改"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "继续编辑": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep Editing"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "繼續編輯"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存对规则的修改？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save changes to the rules?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "儲存對規則的修改？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "离开后，未保存的修改会丢失。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unsaved changes are lost on leaving."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "離開後，未儲存的修改會遺失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仍有错误，暂无法保存。离开后，未保存的修改将丢失。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Errors remain; the rules cannot be saved yet. Unsaved changes are lost on leaving."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仍有錯誤，暫無法儲存。離開後，未儲存的修改將遺失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已恢复上次未保存的修改": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restored unsaved changes"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已恢復上次未儲存的修改"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 行生效": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld lines apply"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 行生效"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 行不支持": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld lines unsupported"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld 行不支援"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "查看已保存的抓包": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "View Saved Captures"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看已儲存的抓包"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "隧道没有连接。断开前抓到的内容已加密保存，可以打开查看和导出。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The tunnel is not connected. What was captured before it disconnected is saved encrypted; open it to view and export."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隧道沒有連線。中斷前抓到的內容已加密儲存，可以開啟檢視和匯出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个会话里没有解密出的请求。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This session has no decrypted requests."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個工作階段裡沒有解密出的請求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打包导出 zip": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Export as zip"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打包匯出 zip"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请求列表改为显示此会话，实时抓包继续进行，可随时返回。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The request list shows this session instead. Live capture keeps running; return to it at any time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請求列表改為顯示此工作階段，即時擷取繼續進行，可隨時返回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请求列表改为显示这个会话。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The request list shows this session instead."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請求列表改為顯示這個工作階段。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会话用仅保存在本机钥匙串中的密钥加密，保留 7 天后自动删除。隧道断开时自动保存当次抓包；打开会话后请求列表显示其内容，长按可打包导出。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sessions are encrypted with a key kept only in this device's keychain and deleted after 7 days. The capture of each tunnel run is saved automatically on disconnect; an open session shows in the request list, and touch and hold exports it as a zip."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作階段用僅保存在本機鑰匙圈中的金鑰加密，保留 7 天後自動刪除。通道中斷時自動儲存當次擷取；開啟工作階段後請求列表顯示其內容，長按可打包匯出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这台设备上无法打开会话（钥匙串不可用）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sessions cannot be opened on this device (the keychain is unavailable)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這台裝置上無法開啟工作階段（鑰匙圈無法使用）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "暂无已保存的会话。隧道断开时自动保存当次抓包，也可在请求列表右上角“更多”中保存。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No saved sessions. The capture is saved automatically when the tunnel disconnects, and can also be saved from More at the top right of the request list."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暫無已儲存的工作階段。通道中斷時自動儲存當次擷取，也可在請求列表右上角「更多」中儲存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打包导出 zip（遮盖密码和 Cookie）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Export as zip (passwords and cookies masked)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打包匯出 zip（遮蓋密碼和 Cookie）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "隧道已断开，下面是断开前抓到的内容，已加密保存 7 天，可以在 ⋯ 里打包导出。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The tunnel disconnected. Below is what was captured before that, saved encrypted for 7 days; export it as a zip from ⋯."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隧道已中斷，下面是中斷前抓到的內容，已加密儲存 7 天，可以在 ⋯ 裡打包匯出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在查看已保存的会话：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Viewing saved session: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在檢視已儲存的工作階段：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "回到实时抓包": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Back to Live Capture"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回到即時抓包"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭会话": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Close Session"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "關閉工作階段"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打包导出 zip（完整，不遮盖）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Export as zip (complete, unmasked)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打包匯出 zip（完整，不遮蓋）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "zip 内含连接清单、HAR 和 pcapng。“完整”不遮盖账号、Cookie 等敏感信息，请仅发给信任的人。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The zip holds a connection list, HAR and pcapng. “Complete” does not mask accounts, cookies or other sensitive data; share it only with trusted people."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zip 內含連線清單、HAR 和 pcapng。「完整」不遮蓋帳號、Cookie 等敏感資訊，請僅傳給信任的人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "隧道已断开。断开前的抓包会自动保存，可以在请求页右上角 ⋯ › 已保存的会话 查看和导出。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The tunnel disconnected. The capture from before that is saved automatically; view and export it from ⋯ › Saved Sessions at the top right of the Requests page."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隧道已中斷。中斷前的抓包會自動儲存，可以在請求頁右上角 ⋯ › 已儲存的工作階段 檢視和匯出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已保存的抓包中没有此连接：它出现在最后一次保存之后，或已被较新的连接挤出。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This connection is not in the saved capture: it appeared after the last save, or newer connections pushed it out."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已儲存的擷取中沒有此連線：它出現在最後一次儲存之後，或已被較新的連線擠出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将手机的 Wi-Fi 代理设为这台 Mac（同一 Wi-Fi）后，手机请求出现在请求页。仅接受局域网设备，默认需用户名和密码；断开连接时关闭。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With the phone's Wi-Fi proxy set to this Mac on the same Wi-Fi, the phone's requests appear on the Requests page. Only local network devices are accepted, a username and password are required by default, and it turns off on disconnect."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "將手機的 Wi-Fi 代理設為這台 Mac（同一 Wi-Fi）後，手機請求出現在請求頁。僅接受區域網路裝置，預設需使用者名稱和密碼；中斷連線時關閉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "需要密码": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Require Password"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要密碼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手机要在 Wi-Fi 代理里填用户名和密码才能使用这个代理": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Phones must enter the username and password in their Wi-Fi proxy settings to use this proxy"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "手機要在 Wi-Fi 代理裡填使用者名稱和密碼才能使用這個代理"
