    "重新生成用户名和密码": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Make a New Username and Password"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新產生使用者名稱和密碼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用随机数生成，只保存在这台 Mac 的钥匙串里。重新生成后，已经设置过的手机要重新填写。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Randomly generated and kept only in this Mac's keychain. After making new ones, phones set up before must enter them again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以隨機數產生，只儲存在這台 Mac 的鑰匙圈裡。重新產生後，已經設定過的手機要重新填寫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "任何人都能使用此代理：同一网络内的设备均可通过这台 Mac 和所用节点上网，其请求也会进入抓包。仅在可信网络中关闭密码。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anyone can use this proxy: any device on the same network can go online through this Mac and its nodes, and its requests end up in the capture. Turn the password off only on a trusted network."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任何人都能使用此代理：同一網路內的裝置均可透過這台 Mac 和所用節點上網，其請求也會進入擷取。僅在可信網路中關閉密碼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone：在 Wi-Fi 代理设置中开启认证并填写上方用户名和密码。Android 的 Wi-Fi 代理无密码栏，浏览器首次访问时询问，其他应用可能无法连接。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone: turn on Authentication in the Wi-Fi proxy settings and enter the username and password above. Android's Wi-Fi proxy has no password field; the browser asks on first visit and other apps may not connect."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone：在 Wi-Fi 代理設定中開啟認證並填寫上方使用者名稱和密碼。Android 的 Wi-Fi 代理無密碼欄，瀏覽器首次造訪時詢問，其他 App 可能無法連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法读取钥匙串里的手机抓包密码，手机抓包没有开启。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The phone debugging password could not be read from the keychain, so phone debugging did not turn on."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法讀取鑰匙圈裡的手機抓包密碼，手機抓包沒有開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法把手机抓包密码保存到钥匙串。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The phone debugging password could not be saved to the keychain."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法把手機抓包密碼儲存到鑰匙圈。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手机抓包没有用新的设置重新开启，请关闭后再打开。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Phone debugging did not restart with the new settings. Turn it off and on again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "手機抓包沒有用新的設定重新開啟，請關閉後再開啟。"
