            "value": "The system reconnects automatically after an unexpected exit. Disconnecting manually turns this off too; it turns back on at the next connection."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "意外結束後由系統自動重新連線；手動中斷時會一併關閉，下次連線再開啟。"
